OL,3,AMajor tech and AI stocks plummet as
OL,4,ANasdaq loses $2.5tn in value
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor tech firms including Nvidia,
OL,7,FSpaceX and Tesla have lost hundreds of
OL,8,Fbillions of dollars in market value,
OL,9,Fand more than $2 trillion was wiped
OL,10,Ffrom the tech-heavy Nasdaq composite
OL,11,Fstock index in a market rout.
OL,13,FShares in firms across the tech and
OL,14,Fartificial intelligence sectors
OL,15,Fplummeted, partly driven by concerns of
OL,16,Ftougher regulation following Democratic
OL,17,Fwins in key data centre states.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
