OL,3,AMajor tech and AI stocks plummet as
OL,4,ANasdaq loses $2.5tn in value
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose losses dragged the Nasdaq down by
OL,7,Fmore than 5.5%, losing an estimated
OL,8,F$2.5tn in market capitalisation,
OL,9,Faccording to Dow Jones data, while
OL,10,Fother key US stock indexes also saw big
OL,11,Flosses.
OL,13,FFollowing the election, some tech
OL,14,Fleaders said they needed to put more
OL,15,Feffort into marketing data centres and
OL,16,FAI.
